  <item>
    <title>EP01｜人生也是可以看看攻略打下去的！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6613f2f148c40e2fb003ef0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6613f2f148c40e2fb003ef0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Apr 2024 13:36:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello大家好，我是八梨</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客基本都是闲聊，内容也可能会比较琐碎～特别是第一期～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 没啥用的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 简单讲西玄不同工具的使用差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 我个人的“玄学观”</span></p><span></span><p><span>（第一期没有准备太多，会比较笼统～）</span></p><span></span><p><span>与命定论相比，命理工具更像是“游戏攻略”</span></p><span></span><p><span>看攻略打游戏还是不太一样的哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>至少你知道自己该出什么装备，该捡什么道具，该主升什么技能～</span></p><span></span><p><span>脱离“经验主义”，找到属于自己的路线才是正解！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhQmpRFENRoho9MQiRMByINmEXIb.m4a" length="87115647" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0UHFtM0J0SXB1Y3JKSVN0dlhJeFgzNzB5SWcucG5n.png"/>
